{+- Holds no credential. It calls into the Pi install that `pi` on `PATH` resolves to, and Pi resolves its own credential from its own store or the caller's environment (for the `official` provider, `TYPESAFE_API_KEY`). The module never reads it.+}
{+- The `.cjs` callers require this file, so it ships no top-level await and reaches the Pi SDK with a lazy import inside the Pi branch only.+}

