{+- Holds the report pieces the classifier scorers share: a pin of the rows a run scored, the check for an output directory that already holds a run, the probability-aware pick that sums each answer's probability over a row's orders, decided-subset accuracy, margin slack against the 0.10 margin and a bootstrap interval that resamples whole clusters of rows.+}
{+- The injection-screen scorer imports it, so its pins and report lines come from this one copy.+}
{+- Makes no call and reads no credential.+}

